  <fishName>k__BackingField: garibaldi
  <fishFact>k__BackingField: "Don't underestimate the shrimp \u2014 these tiny crustaceans
    punch well above their weight. The pistol shrimp can snap its claw so fast it
    creates a bubble that briefly reaches the temperature of the sun's surface, stunning
    prey in an instant. Many shrimp species also serve as ocean \"cleaners,\" setting
    up stations on reefs where fish line up to have parasites picked off \u2014 a
    full-service spa, underwater style."
